# Generated audit reports carry product/vendor/integration names + production uuids
# straight out of the catalog. They are operator artifacts, produced fresh on every
# run — never committed. The dated measurement that matters lives in README.md.
report-*.json

# The rollback-ready id list the audit emits alongside each report. Same reasoning:
# it is a production id dump, regenerated on every run.
stranded-ids-*.txt

# Upstream snapshot (see audit.mjs). Production catalog content, regenerated on demand.
.upstream-cache.json
